# ==================== 行尾统一 ====================
# 标准策略: 入库(LF), Windows 检出(CRLF), 其他系统检出(LF)
# 避免 CubeMX/Keil 在不同平台重新生成代码时产生行尾假 diff

* text=auto

# C/C++ 源码
*.c text
*.h text

# 构建 / 工程配置
*.uvprojx text
*.uvoptx text
*.uvguix text
*.ioc text
*.mxproject text
*.sct text
*.ld text
*.icf text

# 脚本 / 文档
*.py text
*.bat text
*.md text
*.txt text
*.sh text

# ==================== 二进制文件（禁止行尾转换）====================
*.o binary
*.axf binary
*.hex binary
*.bin binary
*.srec binary
*.lnp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.bmp binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
